[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0000","text":"训练师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0010","text":"七草！你慢了一拍！\n从前面的转身开始就要注意速度！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0020","text":"————对不起！\n请再来一遍！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0030","text":"日花酱辛苦了！\n柠檬水，来一杯？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0040","text":"…………谢了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0050","text":"柠檬水那种甜味和清爽感并存的感觉\n我很喜欢呢。……啊抱歉，我是不是太吵了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0060","text":"……不好意思\n没事，只是有点累"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0070","text":"课练确实很辛苦嘛～……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0080","text":"不过日花酱真的超努力的，\n大家还在说可不能输给你呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0090","text":"……是那样吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0100","text":"嗯！\n我代表大家来传达的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0110","text":"…………是吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0120","text":"嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0130","text":"——啊，柠檬水要变温了！\n抱歉抱歉，请喝……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0140","text":"————那我就不客气了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02022400_03_0150","text":"好的！"}]
